  "learningOutcomes": [
    "identifies the changes that led to the evolution of the Later Vedic period.",
    "summarizes the lifestyle of the Later Vedic period by relating it to the epics.",
    "explains the processes that led to the classification of society in the Later Vedic period into the four varnas or the caste system.",
    "identifies and discusses the differences and similarities between the Early and Later Vedic periods.",
    "traces the changing position of women in the Early and Later Vedic societies.",
    "analyses and appreciates the rich cultural heritage of India in terms of values, beliefs and traditions."
